{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Crea un carosello orizzontale di video verticali in formato 9:16, stile reels di Instagram.
    
    Ogni video è una slide ripetibile (blocchi annidati, non slot fissi) con: video caricato dalla libreria, immagine di copertina opzionale, titolo, testo breve, valutazione a stelle da 0 a 5 con mezze stelle, link e testo del pulsante.
    
    Comportamento: i video partono in autoplay senza audio solo quando entrano nel viewport e vanno in pausa quando escono; un pulsante attiva l'audio e solo un video alla volta può avere l'audio attivo; un pulsante mette in play/pausa; cliccando sul video si mette in play/pausa. I video vanno caricati in lazy, non tutti all'avvio.
    
    Layout: 4 video affiancati su desktop, 3 su tablet, 1,2 su mobile in modo che si intraveda la card successiva. Scorrimento con swipe su touch e trascinamento col mouse, più frecce laterali e puntini di navigazione.
    
    Impostazioni: formato card (9:16, 4:5, 1:1, 16:9), numero di video visibili per desktop/tablet/mobile, spazio tra le card, raggio degli angoli, sfumatura scura in basso per la leggibilità del testo, colori di testo, stelle, frecce e pulsante, spaziatura sopra e sotto.
    
    Usa solo CSS e JavaScript nativi, nessuna libreria esterna. Testo dei pulsanti accessibile per screen reader e nessun autoplay se l'utente ha attivato la riduzione delle animazioni.
{% enddoc %}

{% comment %}
  Implementazione rivista. Correzioni rispetto alla prima generazione:
    - la sorgente del video viene scelta in base alla larghezza reale della card
      e al DPR, invece di prendere sempre sources[1] (che è vuoto quando il
      video ha una sola sorgente, e lasciava src="")
    - lo scorrimento usa scroll-snap nativo invece di un transform manuale: su
      mobile non serve piu preventDefault sul touchmove, che bloccava lo scroll
      verticale della pagina
    - niente indice frazionario con 1,2 video per vista
    - niente salto di slide al click (currentX non azzerato)
    - i video vengono agganciati solo quando entrano nel viewport
    - ricalcolo su resize e cambio di orientamento
    - l'audio si rimuta quando la card esce dallo schermo
  Gli ID delle impostazioni sono invariati, gli slot passano da 6 a 10.
{% endcomment %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: var(--aivc-pt-m);
    padding-bottom: var(--aivc-pb-m);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__viewport {
    position: relative;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__track {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--aivc-gap-m);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 2px;
    list-style: none;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__track::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-dragging .aivc__track {
    scroll-behavior: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: none;
    cursor: grabbing;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }}.is-dragging .aivc__card * {
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__slide {
    flex: 0 0 var(--aivc-slide-w-m);
    width: var(--aivc-slide-w-m);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    scroll-snap-stop: always;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__card {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: var(--aivc-ratio);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--aivc-radius);
    background-color: #000;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__media,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__media video,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__media img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 0;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__poster {
    z-index: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__card.is-playing .aivc__poster {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: var(--aivc-scrim);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__hit {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 3;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__controls {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl:hover {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl:active {
    transform: scale(0.92);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl .aivc-icon--on,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl[aria-pressed='true'] .aivc-icon--off {
    display: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl[aria-pressed='true'] .aivc-icon--on {
    display: block;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__content {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0 0;
    z-index: 4;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    color: var(--aivc-text-color);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__content > * {
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__content:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__description {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: inherit;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars-row--fill {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: var(--aivc-rating);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars svg {
    flex: none;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars-row--empty svg {
    fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__stars-row--fill svg {
    fill: var(--aivc-star-color);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: var(--aivc-btn-bg);
    color: var(--aivc-btn-color);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    z-index: 6;
    display: none;
    place-items: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--aivc-arrow-bg);
    color: var(--aivc-arrow-color);
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow:hover:not([disabled]) {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow--prev {
    left: 8px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow--next {
    right: 8px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }}.show-arrows-mobile .aivc__arrow {
    display: grid;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--aivc-arrow-color);
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__dot[aria-current='true'] {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.2);
  }

  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__ctrl:focus-visible,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__hit:focus-visible,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow:focus-visible,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__dot:focus-visible,
  .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: var(--aivc-pt);
      padding-bottom: var(--aivc-pb);
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__track {
      gap: var(--aivc-gap);
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__slide {
      flex-basis: var(--aivc-slide-w-t);
      width: var(--aivc-slide-w-t);
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__title {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__description {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow {
      display: grid;
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow--prev {
      left: 16px;
    }

    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__arrow--next {
      right: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__slide {
      flex-basis: var(--aivc-slide-w);
      width: var(--aivc-slide-w);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} .aivc__track {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

{%- liquid
  assign ratio = '9 / 16'
  case block.settings.aspect_ratio
    when '4:5'
      assign ratio = '4 / 5'
    when '1:1'
      assign ratio = '1 / 1'
    when '16:9'
      assign ratio = '16 / 9'
  endcase

  assign gap = block.settings.card_gap
  assign per_d = block.settings.slides_desktop
  assign per_t = block.settings.slides_tablet
  assign per_m = block.settings.slides_mobile

  assign scrim = 'none'
  if block.settings.enable_gradient
    assign scrim = 'linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, ' | append: block.settings.gradient_opacity | append: '))'
  endif
-%}

<video-carousel-ai
  class="aivc-{{ ai_gen_id }} aivc{% if block.settings.show_arrows_mobile %} show-arrows-mobile{% endif %}"
  data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}"
  style="
    --aivc-pt: {{ block.settings.spacing_top }}px;
    --aivc-pb: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom }}px;
    --aivc-pt-m: {{ block.settings.spacing_top | times: 0.6 | round: 0 }}px;
    --aivc-pb-m: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom | times: 0.6 | round: 0 }}px;
    --aivc-gap: {{ gap }}px;
    --aivc-gap-m: {{ gap | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    --aivc-slide-w: calc((100% - {{ per_d | minus: 1 }} * {{ gap }}px) / {{ per_d }});
    --aivc-slide-w-t: calc((100% - {{ per_t | minus: 1 }} * {{ gap }}px) / {{ per_t }});
    --aivc-slide-w-m: calc((100% - {{ per_m | minus: 1 }} * {{ gap | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px) / {{ per_m }});
    --aivc-ratio: {{ ratio }};
    --aivc-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    --aivc-scrim: {{ scrim }};
    --aivc-text-color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    --aivc-star-color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
    --aivc-btn-bg: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    --aivc-btn-color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    --aivc-arrow-bg: {{ block.settings.arrow_background }};
    --aivc-arrow-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
  "
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="aivc__viewport">
    <button type="button" class="aivc__arrow aivc__arrow--prev" data-aivc-prev aria-label="Video precedente">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <ul class="aivc__track" data-aivc-track role="list">
      {%- for i in (1..10) -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign vkey = 'video_' | append: i
          assign pkey = 'poster_' | append: i
          assign tkey = 'title_' | append: i
          assign dkey = 'description_' | append: i
          assign rkey = 'rating_' | append: i
          assign lkey = 'cta_link_' | append: i
          assign ckey = 'cta_text_' | append: i

          assign video = block.settings[vkey]
          assign poster = block.settings[pkey]
          assign title = block.settings[tkey]
          assign description = block.settings[dkey]
          assign rating = block.settings[rkey]
          assign cta_link = block.settings[lkey]
          assign cta_text = block.settings[ckey]

          if poster == blank and video != blank
            assign poster = video.preview_image
          endif
        -%}

        {%- if video == blank -%}
          {%- continue -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        <li class="aivc__slide" data-aivc-slide>
          <div class="aivc__card" data-aivc-card>
            <div class="aivc__media">
              <video
                data-aivc-video
                data-aivc-sources='[{% for s in video.sources %}{% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}{"url":{{ s.url | json }},"w":{{ s.width | default: 0 | json }},"type":{{ s.mime_type | json }}}{% endfor %}]'
                {% if poster != blank %}poster="{{ poster | image_url: width: 720 }}"{% endif %}
                muted
                loop
                playsinline
                preload="none"
                disablepictureinpicture
                tabindex="-1"
                {% if title != blank %}aria-label="{{ title | escape }}"{% endif %}
              ></video>

              {%- if poster != blank -%}
                <img
                  class="aivc__poster"
                  src="{{ poster | image_url: width: 720 }}"
                  srcset="{{ poster | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ poster | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ poster | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w"
                  sizes="(min-width: 990px) calc(100vw / {{ per_d }}), (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw / {{ per_t }}), calc(100vw / {{ per_m }})"
                  alt="{{ poster.alt | default: title | escape }}"
                  width="{{ poster.width }}"
                  height="{{ poster.height }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                >
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <div class="aivc__overlay"></div>

            <button type="button" class="aivc__hit" data-aivc-toggle aria-label="Riproduci o metti in pausa il video"></button>

            <div class="aivc__controls">
              <button type="button" class="aivc__ctrl" data-aivc-play aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Riproduci o metti in pausa">
                <svg class="aivc-icon--off" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
                </svg>
                <svg class="aivc-icon--on" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                  <rect x="6" y="4" width="4" height="16"></rect>
                  <rect x="14" y="4" width="4" height="16"></rect>
                </svg>
              </button>

              <button type="button" class="aivc__ctrl" data-aivc-sound aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Attiva o disattiva l'audio">
                <svg class="aivc-icon--off" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon>
                  <line x1="23" y1="9" x2="17" y2="15"></line>
                  <line x1="17" y1="9" x2="23" y2="15"></line>
                </svg>
                <svg class="aivc-icon--on" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon>
                  <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"></path>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="aivc__content">
              {%- if title != blank -%}
                <p class="aivc__title">{{ title | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if description != blank -%}
                <p class="aivc__description">{{ description | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if rating > 0 -%}
                {%- assign rating_pct = rating | times: 20 -%}
                <div class="aivc__stars" style="--aivc-rating: {{ rating_pct }}%;" role="img" aria-label="{{ rating }} stelle su 5">
                  <div class="aivc__stars-row aivc__stars-row--empty" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- for s in (1..5) -%}
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                  <div class="aivc__stars-row aivc__stars-row--fill" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- for s in (1..5) -%}
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if cta_text != blank and cta_link != blank -%}
                <a class="aivc__cta" href="{{ cta_link }}">{{ cta_text | escape }}</a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

    <button type="button" class="aivc__arrow aivc__arrow--next" data-aivc-next aria-label="Video successivo">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  {%- if block.settings.show_dots -%}
    <div class="aivc__dots" data-aivc-dots></div>
  {%- endif -%}
</video-carousel-ai>

<script>
  (function () {
    if (customElements.get('video-carousel-ai')) return;

    var REDUCED = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');

    function pickSource(sources, targetWidth, probe) {
      var usable = sources.filter(function (s) {
        return s.url && (!s.type || probe.canPlayType(s.type) !== '');
      });
      if (!usable.length) return null;

      var webm = usable.filter(function (s) { return /webm/.test(s.type || ''); });
      var pool = webm.length && probe.canPlayType('video/webm') !== '' ? webm : usable;

      pool.sort(function (a, b) { return (a.w || 0) - (b.w || 0); });

      for (var i = 0; i < pool.length; i++) {
        if ((pool[i].w || 0) >= targetWidth) return pool[i];
      }
      return pool[pool.length - 1];
    }

    class VideoCarouselAI extends HTMLElement {
      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-aivc-track]');
        if (!this.track) return;

        this.slides = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-aivc-slide]'));
        this.autoplay = this.dataset.autoplay === 'true' && !REDUCED.matches;

        this.buildDots();
        this.bindArrows();
        this.bindDrag();
        this.bindCards();
        this.observe();

        this.onScroll = this.raf(this.update.bind(this));
        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll, { passive: true });

        this.onResize = this.raf(this.update.bind(this));
        window.addEventListener('resize', this.onResize, { passive: true });
        window.addEventListener('orientationchange', this.onResize, { passive: true });

        this.update();
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        if (this.io) this.io.disconnect();
        if (this.onScroll) this.track.removeEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll);
        if (this.onResize) {
          window.removeEventListener('resize', this.onResize);
          window.removeEventListener('orientationchange', this.onResize);
        }
      }

      raf(fn) {
        var ticking = false;
        return function () {
          if (ticking) return;
          ticking = true;
          requestAnimationFrame(function () {
            ticking = false;
            fn();
          });
        };
      }

      /* ---------- navigazione ---------- */

      step() {
        var first = this.slides[0];
        if (!first) return this.track.clientWidth;
        var gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).columnGap) || 0;
        return first.getBoundingClientRect().width + gap;
      }

      scrollBySlides(direction) {
        this.track.scrollBy({
          left: this.step() * direction,
          behavior: REDUCED.matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth'
        });
      }

      bindArrows() {
        this.prev = this.querySelector('[data-aivc-prev]');
        this.next = this.querySelector('[data-aivc-next]');
        if (this.prev) this.prev.addEventListener('click', this.scrollBySlides.bind(this, -1));
        if (this.next) this.next.addEventListener('click', this.scrollBySlides.bind(this, 1));
      }

      buildDots() {
        this.dotsWrap = this.querySelector('[data-aivc-dots]');
        if (!this.dotsWrap) return;
        this.dots = this.slides.map(function (slide, i) {
          var dot = document.createElement('button');
          dot.type = 'button';
          dot.className = 'aivc__dot';
          dot.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Vai al video ' + (i + 1));
          dot.addEventListener('click', this.goTo.bind(this, i));
          this.dotsWrap.appendChild(dot);
          return dot;
        }, this);
      }

      goTo(index) {
        var slide = this.slides[index];
        if (!slide) return;
        var trackBox = this.track.getBoundingClientRect();
        var slideBox = slide.getBoundingClientRect();
        this.track.scrollTo({
          left: this.track.scrollLeft + (slideBox.left - trackBox.left),
          behavior: REDUCED.matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth'
        });
      }

      activeIndex() {
        var left = this.track.getBoundingClientRect().left;
        for (var i = 0; i < this.slides.length; i++) {
          if (this.slides[i].getBoundingClientRect().right > left + 2) return i;
        }
        return Math.max(this.slides.length - 1, 0);
      }

      update() {
        var index = this.activeIndex();
        if (this.dots) {
          this.dots.forEach(function (d, i) {
            d.setAttribute('aria-current', i === index ? 'true' : 'false');
          });
        }
        var max = this.track.scrollWidth - this.track.clientWidth - 1;
        if (this.prev) this.prev.disabled = this.track.scrollLeft <= 1;
        if (this.next) this.next.disabled = this.track.scrollLeft >= max;
      }

      /* ---------- trascinamento col mouse ---------- */

      bindDrag() {
        var startX = 0;
        var startScroll = 0;
        var dragging = false;
        var moved = false;
        var self = this;

        this.track.addEventListener('pointerdown', function (e) {
          if (e.pointerType !== 'mouse' || e.button !== 0) return;
          dragging = true;
          moved = false;
          startX = e.clientX;
          startScroll = self.track.scrollLeft;
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('pointermove', function (e) {
          if (!dragging) return;
          var delta = e.clientX - startX;
          if (!moved && Math.abs(delta) > 4) {
            moved = true;
            self.classList.add('is-dragging');
            self.track.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);
          }
          if (moved) self.track.scrollLeft = startScroll - delta;
        });

        ['pointerup', 'pointercancel', 'pointerleave'].forEach(function (evt) {
          self.track.addEventListener(evt, function () {
            if (!dragging) return;
            dragging = false;
            if (moved) {
              self.classList.remove('is-dragging');
              self.goTo(self.activeIndex());
            }
          });
        });
      }

      /* ---------- video ---------- */

      loadVideo(card) {
        var video = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-video]');
        if (!video || video.dataset.aivcLoaded === 'true') return video;

        var sources;
        try {
          sources = JSON.parse(video.dataset.aivcSources || '[]');
        } catch (e) {
          sources = [];
        }

        var target = card.getBoundingClientRect().width * (window.devicePixelRatio || 1);
        var best = pickSource(sources, target, video);
        if (!best) return video;

        video.src = best.url;
        video.dataset.aivcLoaded = 'true';
        video.load();
        return video;
      }

      play(card) {
        var video = this.loadVideo(card);
        if (!video) return;
        video.muted = card.dataset.aivcUnmuted !== 'true';
        var p = video.play();
        if (p && p.catch) p.catch(function () {});
      }

      pause(card) {
        var video = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-video]');
        if (video) video.pause();
      }

      setSound(card, on) {
        card.dataset.aivcUnmuted = on ? 'true' : 'false';

        if (on) {
          var self = this;
          document.querySelectorAll('.aivc [data-aivc-card]').forEach(function (other) {
            if (other !== card && other.dataset.aivcUnmuted === 'true') self.setSound(other, false);
          });
        }

        var video = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-video]');
        if (video) {
          video.muted = !on;
          if (on && video.paused) this.play(card);
        }

        var btn = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-sound]');
        if (btn) btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');
      }

      bindCards() {
        var self = this;

        this.querySelectorAll('[data-aivc-card]').forEach(function (card) {
          var video = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-video]');
          var playBtn = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-play]');
          var soundBtn = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-sound]');
          var hit = card.querySelector('[data-aivc-toggle]');

          function toggle() {
            if (video && !video.paused && !video.ended) {
              card.dataset.aivcPaused = 'true';
              self.pause(card);
            } else {
              card.dataset.aivcPaused = 'false';
              self.play(card);
            }
          }

          if (hit) hit.addEventListener('click', toggle);
          if (playBtn) playBtn.addEventListener('click', toggle);

          if (soundBtn) {
            soundBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
              self.setSound(card, card.dataset.aivcUnmuted !== 'true');
            });
          }

          if (video) {
            video.addEventListener('playing', function () {
              card.classList.add('is-playing');
              if (playBtn) playBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');
            });
            video.addEventListener('pause', function () {
              if (playBtn) playBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
            });
          }
        });
      }

      observe() {
        var self = this;

        this.io = new IntersectionObserver(
          function (entries) {
            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
              var card = entry.target;
              if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                self.loadVideo(card);
                if (self.autoplay && card.dataset.aivcPaused !== 'true') self.play(card);
              } else {
                self.pause(card);
                if (card.dataset.aivcUnmuted === 'true') self.setSound(card, false);
              }
            });
          },
          { threshold: 0.55 }
        );

        this.querySelectorAll('[data-aivc-card]').forEach(function (card) {
          self.io.observe(card);
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('video-carousel-ai', VideoCarouselAI);
  })();
</script>

